     "id": "src-news-label",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "kind": "source",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "Headlines. External vendor.\n\n**One consumer now** — the sentiment scorer, and nothing else. That makes it the most contained source on the diagram: an outage costs exactly one signal.\n\nIt also makes it the most expensive per unit of use. A whole vendor feed for one scorer is a question somebody should ask out loud."
   },
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "frameId": null,
