   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "kind": "transform",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**Market feed only, as of Aug 2026.** The news read was cut as noise.\n\nWhat went with it: the momentum read can no longer tell a breakout from a knee-jerk reaction to an announcement. That was the thing it was built to do.\n\nWhat was gained: technicals are now genuinely independent of sentiment. When a headline lands, one signal moves, not two."
   },
